    {
      "id": "W7b7-FHVH3VVWULTMcJqz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 516.6735092097582,
      "y": 4.614267100432869,
      "width": 660.4860036450925,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1543845081,
      "version": 1681,
      "versionNonce": 1142455831,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787460825674,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "<What It Consists Of>\n- ERP for internal resource manangement\n- WMS for warehouse managing\n- Additional system for payment management, admin dashboard etc",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "<What It Consists Of>\n- ERP for internal resource manangement\n- WMS for warehouse managing\n- Additional system for payment management, admin dashboard etc",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "DqyjgUIbAnKlA_gMk9HPA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1410.0009225016836,
      "y": 112.63131376884178,
      "width": 1477.141002765791,
      "height": 550,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a9",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1684949687,
      "version": 4530,
      "versionNonce": 1562697913,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787460520683,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "<What It Needs Right Now>\n* System architecture of client's system\n- Our service must understand how client's system works and what it consists of.\n\n* Data flow of client's system. \n- Our service must understand how refund, delivery, CS I/O channels process of client's system works\n\n* Customer Support Policy of client's system\n- Our service must behave in a manner that follows client's policy.\n\n* Programming Interfaces which allows our service to run client's system's function\n- Our service requires legally and programmatically appropriate 'interfaces' that allows our service to run corresponding process in our client's system\n\n* (Optional) Proprietary Core System\n- Core system provides multi-tenancy cost analysis & tracking service for each client.\n- Core system provides 'common services' which is well-organized common requirements from multiple clients.\nThis 'common services' can be otherly phrased as 'Programmable interface' which is basically an programmable abstraction of customer support service\ndata flow, including LLM API call, tool definition & tool calling in the right place at the right moment, Ontology-structured policy reference in the right\nplace at the right moment.\n- Maybe, the understanding for each client's case can be described as 'room' and each client can be described as 'tenant'.\n- The more our practices grow, the better core competences we eartn, thus leading us to better market position.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "right",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "<What It Needs Right Now>\n* System architecture of client's system\n- Our service must understand how client's system works and what it consists of.\n\n* Data flow of client's system. \n- Our service must understand how refund, delivery, CS I/O channels process of client's system works\n\n* Customer Support Policy of client's system\n- Our service must behave in a manner that follows client's policy.\n\n* Programming Interfaces which allows our service to run client's system's function\n- Our service requires legally and programmatically appropriate 'interfaces' that allows our service to run corresponding process in our client's system\n\n* (Optional) Proprietary Core System\n- Core system provides multi-tenancy cost analysis & tracking service for each client.\n- Core system provides 'common services' which is well-organized common requirements from multiple clients.\nThis 'common services' can be otherly phrased as 'Programmable interface' which is basically an programmable abstraction of customer support service data flow, including LLM API call, tool definition & tool calling in the right place at the right moment, Ontology-structured policy reference in the right place at the right moment.\n- Maybe, the understanding for each client's case can be described as 'room' and each client can be described as 'tenant'.\n- The more our practices grow, the better core competences we eartn, thus leading us to better market position.\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
